  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that the RNA-only singleprofile baseline (config_001) has moderate performance, but uncertainty remains about whether multiprofile settings or aggregation methods improve results. This experiment tests multiprofile with avgpool aggregation (vs. singleprofile and no aggregation in config_001), isolating the effect of profile setting and aggregation. It balances exploration of key design choices while keeping RNA encoder and image modalities constant, providing clear evidence on whether these factors matter."
